      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST TAKE IT (6) has a strong record this trip with four wins and three placings from nine starts. Comes off a (23.29) win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths in a Grade 5 over 400m at The Gardens. Looks suited here and rates on top. NOAH BONKERS (2) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (20.20) over 340m at this track. Likely to be in the finish again. SWEET STREET (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (20.24) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Should play a prominent role. UNHURRIED (7) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
